Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

SupplyCap 720tr -> 9.000.000.000. MinValidatorStake 2.000 -> 25.000.
MaxValidatorStake 50tr -> 625.000.000. MinDelegatorStake 25 -> 312,5.

Bang phan bo moi: 6 bucket gop thanh 5 hang muc cong bo.
  Foundation 12% = self-bond 8.999.991 (dia chi RIENG) + 1.071.000.009
  Community  30% = faucet nong 99.999.999 (100% C-Chain) + 2.600.000.001
  Private Sale 9% (moi) · Team 9% · Staking Rewards 40% khong cap o genesis
Phat hanh genesis 5.400.000.000, quy mint 3.600.000.000.

InitialStakeDurationOffset 5400s -> 7 ngay: voi 9 node thi offset cu lam
ca mang het han trong 12 tieng, van la 'chet cung mot luc'.
